  "description": "A notorious pirate with a bounty on her head. The world called her the “Judge of Salvation.” But what Daphne wants is neither justice nor salvation. It is nothing but revenge against the kingdom that destroyed her mother and her family and took everything from her. However, her voyage of revenge takes an unexpected turn. A man she spent a single night with after a chance encounter. She had no idea he would turn out to be the most relentless naval officer from the very kingdom that was hunting her down. A revolution shaking the kingdom to its core, hidden conspiracies, and one man who keeps throwing a wrench in her plans. Caught in the whirlwind of revenge and revolution, will Daphne finally reach the end she desires? \n\n(Source: KakaoPage, translated)",
